体验家🎬，沉浸于电影世界探索多元人生，在光影叙事中为平凡日常注入诗意与温度🌿。我坚信真诚的联结能治愈孤独，用心与朋友相处，收获的不仅是陪伴更是灵魂共鸣的自由💫。\n\n我享受将生活过成诗的状态🌍，带着好奇奔赴清新旅行，在陌生街角捕捉\"good vibes only\"的小确幸，用镜头定格阳光洒落的美好瞬间☀️。音乐是我的情绪解药🎵，在旋律流淌中沉淀内心，收获身心舒展的舒适感。\n\n生活于我是一场持续发现美好的旅程✨，从电影想象到旅行真实，从音乐疗愈到友谊滋养，始终以热忱拥抱平凡中的不凡，让日子在热爱里闪闪发光🌟。", "isMine": true, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260210/24db8c5572ca9c1b71362a6ff23ebf56ffd6731f72d90f928ae609591d7e0f02.png", "memberStatus": true, "memberExpireDate": "2026/03/08", "circleMemberId": "2018867915568107521", "applyTime": null, "isOwner": true}], "isCircleExist": true, "checkInStatus": 2, "backgroundUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/background/circle/default.png", "hasActivity": false}], "total": 25, "nextStartId": null}, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Mon, 09 Feb 2026 21:11:06 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "Connection": "keep-alive", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "1113075-1770671466747-7502", "lubanops-ntrace-id": "1113075-1770671466747-7502", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "appservice-request-id": "10207"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
